From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000020 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Port Bot <port@local>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 21:19:14 +0200
Subject: 0020: flag-gate the core Node Terminal tab

Add a NODE_TERMINAL_PLUGIN_FLAG (TERMINAL_PLUGIN_NODE_TERMINAL_ENABLED)
check to NodeDetailsPage.tsx's pagesFor, mirroring the existing
!isWindowsNode(node) conditional-tab pattern (and usePrometheusGate
elsewhere). When the terminal console plugin's own backend reports
NODE_TERMINAL_ENABLED=true, it sets this flag via a console.flag
extension and contributes its own Node Terminal tab (a
console.tab/horizontalNav extension, which can only add a tab, never
replace one) - this patch is the other half of that pair, letting core
step aside so exactly one Node Terminal tab is ever shown. Unset (the
default, and the only possible state on a console without that
plugin) leaves this tab exactly as it was.
---
 .../src/components/nodes/NodeDetailsPage.tsx    | 17 +++++++++++++++--
 1 file changed, 15 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

